leted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Analysis context types:** https://github.com/dotnet/roslyn/blob/main/src/Compilers/Core/Portable/DiagnosticAnalyzer/DiagnosticAnalysisContext.cs\r\n\r\n**Context:** This types were originally made public with the intent of allowing custom analyzer hosts to implement their own analyzer driver implementations, which would have required these constructors to be public. Since then, we have introduced `CompilationWithAnalyzers` type, which is the primary public API from the compiler layer for custom analyzer execution for individual documents/spans. We don't believe there are any custom analyzer driver implementations out there which need the public constructors for analysis context types. This issue tracks marking all of them as obsolete.","closed_by":{"login":"mavasani","id":10605811,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjA1ODEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10605811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavasani","html_url":"https://github.com/mavasani","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavasani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavasani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavasani/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavasani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavasani/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavasani/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavasani/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavasani/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mavasani/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/roslyn/issues/63440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeli